WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
Zexy's The Space Action Adventure!

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:27.260
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.020
I'm Mike. I'm Sean.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.340
And I'm Joe.

