So, I guess, like, I just conflicted, like, was it intentional to sound like that?

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:58.100
Or is this really like one of the first games you can think of where they just didn't bother to change whatever the title was in Japan and it sounds very Japanese?

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:06.940
I'm pretty sure Zexy's is just an early member of Organization 13 if anyone is a Kingdom Hearts fan.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.720
So, what would be their original name?

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.300
I don't know. I didn't think that part through.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.720
What would that be? What would that be?

