00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:02.700
Well, I don't know. Whatever.

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:03.840
This is more than just a Shmup.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:04.820
There's a lot more to it.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.660
