00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.100
Like, what am I thinking of?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.280
Another X name that was a Shmup.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.160
Xevious? Xevious was, yep, absolutely.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:22.600
All right. And then, yeah, the back of the box said the space action adventure.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.280
So, Joe, maybe if they just changed it to the Shmup action adventure,

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:30.420
