00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:34.280
It does have action platforming.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:39.720
And it's also kind of an adventure game with some light, I don't want to call them RPG,

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:44.920
but at least there's, you know, dialogue and a world and some currency system.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:50.840
Yeah, exactly. There's some form of exploration, even if it is just like once you leave the level, you've left it for good.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.060
So that's kind of cool.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:06:00.880
But before we talk about the actual game, I wanted to go over the story because obviously you don't get a name like Xexis without a very interesting story included in your manual.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.680
And so I'm going to just read the beats.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:04.680
Feel free to interject.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.460
I'll kind of leave a little pause if you feel like you have something worth saying.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:12.620
But Xexis takes place in the year 2777.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.300
And I wondered, do you say 2777?

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.300
That's long. No, it's 2777.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.020
Or do you say 2777?

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.540
Yeah, 2777.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:22.460
It's the year 2777.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:26.260
And Earth is now in a totally different atmosphere.

