00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.820
Like the atmosphere of Earth has changed?

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.040
Or like we moved to another atmosphere?

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:39.740
Yeah, I guess. I took it as the atmosphere has changed because I don't think you can move to another one.

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:41.360
Oh yeah, it's entirely possible. Yeah.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:50.400
You know, even, you know, in the prehistoric times, like we had too much oxygen and made all the bugs big.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:52.340
Read it up. Look it up in a book.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:07:08.080
I imagine that this new atmosphere is a result of the numerous nuclear wars slash natural disasters, which can definitely happen, especially by the year 2777, because they're imminent right now.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:12.040
And as a result, the population has decreased dramatically.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:19.080
And all of the continents of Earth and all the landmass has been reduced to just five small islands.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:25.540
And those five islands formed a nation where for hundreds of years people lived peacefully.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.860
Can you guess the name of that new nation?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:31.500
Is it Zizik's Road?

00:07:34.360 --> 00:07:36.600
Same ballpark, it's Zexy's.

