That's what the name of the game is, the nation that all of the remaining humans of Earth live on.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.120
It's kind of nonsensical, you know?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.840
Yeah. It's like, why don't, why aren't there like five nations?

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:53.940
Like, don't you think the islands would kind of become tribe-like and not want to interact with one another?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.400
