00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:22.040
Like just make it another planet or just have something with the, you know, like all of a sudden the fact that aliens invaded Earth is all of a sudden a lot more than a lot of the planet.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:25.640
It's more interesting and it doesn't have to take place in the year 2777.

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:27.100
