00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:19.420
And I just felt like that was, um, I don't know, a weird choice for a game that has different, um, different verticality to it and, uh, areas that you can kind of go into.

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:29.360
And as you guys were mentioning, have dialogue encounters with people where they'll either give you tips, give you resources or, uh, whoops, yikes, it's actually a bad place.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:30.400
And you got to fight these dudes.

