Um, you know, I don't know if like, that's, that's really like a huge complaint about the game or just something that, uh, you get used to over time.

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:48.280
Cause I certainly wrote it down early in my notes that like, yeah, I'm constantly firing, but I guess, you know, in most shmups, you're constantly firing too.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:53.420
Right. Yeah. I think what's going on here is two things.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:58.920
