00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:10.280
Um, it also, until you get the, the, the wing boots and then like, it actually feels like something that you can kind of play with instead of fight against.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.640
But that's, that's something else.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:31.480
I think what, what else sort of contributes to this is that I don't know if it's a hitbox thing or if it is just all of the enemies moving in a certain way, but it always felt like if I just shot at a thing, shot at an enemy, like it's not a hundred percent that it's going to hit.

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:38.560
Or like, or like, it'll just shoot just over the top of their head or like just under their jump arc.

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:44.260
It just felt very, uh, if everything, it wasn't even difficult.

