00:35:02.100 --> 00:35:04.820
ups and a ton of interesting enemies and are a lot more fast paced.

00:35:05.320 --> 00:35:12.300
Um, and for me, this was just the right amount of shmuppiness for me because like, yes, it

00:35:12.300 --> 00:35:16.280
was slower, which made it a little more bearable, like not bearable, a little easier, a little

00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:19.300
more completable because it's not the only part of this game.

